From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 00:16:45 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] advapi32/tests: A desktop's security descriptor has a DACL
 now.

d0fe2c7b416 gave window stations and desktops the security descriptors Windows does and left the
todo of test_window_security behind.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/dlls/advapi32/tests/security.c b/dlls/advapi32/tests/security.c
index aa38d5c33c0..28dd6c8d643 100644
--- a/dlls/advapi32/tests/security.c
+++ b/dlls/advapi32/tests/security.c
@@ -8727,7 +8727,7 @@ static void test_window_security(void)
 
     ret = GetSecurityDescriptorDacl(sd, &present, &dacl, &defaulted);
     ok(ret == TRUE, "got error %lu\n", GetLastError());
-    todo_wine ok(present == TRUE, "got present %d\n", present);
+    ok(present == TRUE, "got present %d\n", present);
     ok(defaulted == FALSE, "got defaulted %d\n", defaulted);
 
     LocalFree(sd);
